  THE VERDICT (best gap 200ms): 0.5444 +- 0.0263
    -> REFUSED — the cancellation does not separate same from different; do NOT change the genome

  A REFUSAL IS THE USEFUL OUTCOME AND WAS PRE-COMMITTED TO: it kills the
  combiner for one instrument instead of for a genome change, a
  recalibration and a determinism re-pin. Read `postureA` first -- if the
  posture does not carry A in these units, the refusal is about the
  POSTURE and not about the subtraction.
